# The Python each og tool replaced, kept runnable after its deletion.
# tool<TAB>commit<TAB>source<TAB>interpreter<TAB>og words
#   commit       the parent of the pull request that deleted it
#   source       heredoc:FILE:NAME (the body of NAME=$(cat <<'X' ... X) in FILE) or file:FILE
#   og words     the og subcommand that replaces it; the oracle gets the arguments after them
